# Returning a creature is part of casting the spell: an ability that triggers on it leaving waits until the spell is cast
# (CR 601.2i, 603.3), then goes on the stack above it and resolves first (ruling 2025-09-19). Bot1's Tidehollow Sculler
# exiled one of Bot2's two Lightning Bolts. The Sculler attacks; Bot2 bolts Bot1 with the other, and Bot1 web-slings
# Spider-Sense ({U} from Mox Sapphire), returning the tapped Sculler. The Sculler's leave trigger is put on the stack over
# Spider-Sense and gives Bot2 its exiled Bolt back before Spider-Sense counters the cast one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Tidehollow Sculler
Spider-Sense
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tidehollow Sculler.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Tidehollow Sculler > Bot2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Hand.Spider-Sense.Cast(Stack.Lightning Bolt; Ability: Web-slinging)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Tidehollow Sculler)
? Stack = Tidehollow Sculler; Spider-Sense; Lightning Bolt
? Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack = Spider-Sense; Lightning Bolt
? Exile.Count = 0
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Hand = Plains; Plains; Plains; Tidehollow Sculler
Bot1.Graveyard = Spider-Sense
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
